@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam ParticipantPadding 22
skinparam BoxPadding 14
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #555555
  ArrowFontName SansSerif
  ArrowFontSize 11
  LifeLineBorderColor #BDC3C7
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  ParticipantBorderColor transparent
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #34495E
  ParticipantFontName SansSerif
  ParticipantFontSize 12
  ParticipantFontColor white
  BoxBorderColor transparent
  BoxFontColor #95A5A6
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
  BorderColor #FBC02D
  FontName SansSerif
  FontSize 10
  FontColor #424242
}
title recording one flow, end to end

box "test/e2e" #F0F4FF
participant "It (driver)\nrunner_test.go" as Driver
participant "observeTransitions\nrecorder_test.go" as Rec
end box
participant "API server" as API
participant "operator" as Op
participant "Karta lib" as Karta
database "fixtures/" as Disk

Driver -> API : create Karta def + workload CR
API -> Op : (operator reconciles)
Driver -> Rec : observeTransitions(watch from creation RV)
activate Rec
loop each watch event (a CR)
  Op -> API : drive state: Pending -> Running -> Degraded
  API -> Rec : the CR at this state
  Rec -> Rec : classify() from the CR's OWN\nfields, never from Karta
  Rec -> Rec : capture if settled, state != "",\nand sanitized content is NEW
end
Rec --> Driver : recording (ordered snapshots), on terminal
deactivate Rec
Driver -> Driver : assertObservedOrder()
Driver -> Karta : run on the final live object
Karta --> Driver : MatchedStatuses
note over Driver #FFE0B2 : LIVE GATE - must contain the flow's want,\nelse fail HERE; writeFixture never runs
Driver -> Disk : writeFixture(): per snapshot\ncr.yaml + expected.yaml
@enduml